(globalThis.CATALOGUE_RECORD_CHUNKS??=Object.create(null))[690]={"source_order":690,"notes":["Very faint smudges in the upper margin and the left margin column might be offset from a facing page. No characters can be read in them at native resolution.","The adjacent fol. 345 is also blank apart from its folio number '345'. It is context only and is not transcribed here.","No fragments of a facing page are visible on the target canvas.","Image-reviewed finding: the target page fol. [345b] is blank. The overview and all six native tiles were checked, covering the top, middle and bottom of the page, both margins, the left margin column and the interlinear spaces. No legible writing, folio number, pencil note, tick or ditto mark was found.","Non-text marks were reviewed and judged not to be writing. These are: a short dark slanted stroke with nearby specks at about [2455,1600,50,130]; diffuse grey smudging in the upper left margin column at about [530,350,200,380]; a small rounded stain near the upper outer edge at about [2980,540,100,110]; a small grey blot near the centre at about [1700,2650,100,100]; scattered small specks; and frayed paper fibre at the bottom right corner at about [3070,4740,140,90].","Faint smudges in the upper margin and left margin column may be offset from a facing page. No characters can be read in them at native resolution.","No fragments of a facing page are visible on the target canvas. The adjacent fol. 345 (source order 689) is context only. It is also blank apart from its folio number '345'.","The supplied inventory has no text blocks, so there are no block dispositions to record."],"records":[]};
